    "detailed_description": "Struggling with digital addiction? Need better self-control and fewer distractions? Let Focus Plant assist you!<br><br><strong>Focus Plant is a gamified focus timer</strong> designed to help you manage your time and concentrate on the important things in life. When self-discipline isn't enough to keep you off your distractions, gamification steps in. <br><br>Transform barren landscapes by turning your focus time into raindrops and growing adorable plants. These magical plants will help you manage your time and stay focused on what truly matters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stay focused</h2>Beat digital addiction and stay In control.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150410/extras/ea4ed611a14b6bb2933f83fb3095a1fa.avif?t=1746073617\" width=616 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nurture plants</h2>Use your focus minutes to discover and grow adorable plants.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150410/extras/8dddf7a8a6497a1a7ded8338d06a8d79.avif?t=1746073617\" width=616 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple focus modes</h2>Choose from Pomodoro timer, stopwatch timer, countdown timer, or group focus.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150410/extras/898a8be86818f59d538c1f7105dbe272.avif?t=1746073617\" width=616 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Detailed reports</h2>Track your focus time to better plan your tasks.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150410/extras/2c6d1ee6bfb6dbe8fb2abf6f95ee7157.avif?t=1746073617\" width=616 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play with friends</h2>Focus with your friends and reach your goals.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150410/extras/cdde8d28aa4ef7e68e9e204f373aec2f.avif?t=1746073617\" width=616 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate</h2>Attract visitors and decorate your garden.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150410/extras/9ba3426f4b2f5bc85f3bda991bbb0d78.avif?t=1746073617\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150410/extras/1a62cea614deb13c3dc122bd8f4ae6c8.avif?t=1746073617\" width=616 height=347 /></span>",
